OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle garage and
OL,4,Awarehouse blaze overnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews have been tackling a major
OL,7,Fblaze at a garage and a furniture
OL,8,Fwarehouse overnight.
OL,10,FEight engines were at the fire on
OL,11,FFernhill Road, Bootle, at its height,
OL,12,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,F(MFRS) said.
OL,15,FIt added that the fire was reported at
OL,16,F20:23 BST on Tuesday.
OL,18,FResidents were advised to keep their
OL,19,Fdoors and windows closed and road
OL,20,Fclosures were put in place. MFRS said
OL,21,Fcrews remained at the scene but advised
OL,22,Fmotorists to avoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
